  "description": "A rush of altitude and valley flow in one ride. Our HAIBIKE ALLMTN 4 bursts with riding fun – even when heading up high. That’s why we’ve equipped this all-mountain fully with a specially developed aluminium frame that strikes the perfect balance between weight saving, comfort and stiffness with its distinctive design. On top of that comes a strong component mix: the powerful Bosch Performance CX drive system with 800Wh battery and optional range extender lets you enjoy even long mountain rides without limits. Thanks to 160mm front and 150mm rear travel, you can go full throttle on the descents. And with SRAM gear components, you’ll always be in the right gear. In short: the ideal eMTB for rides where alpine thrills and downhill fun go hand in hand.",
